ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nLi Hua really likes to study folk customs. When he tours Thailand, he accidentally participates in a local traditional festival. The customs and activities of this festival are completely different from what he experiences before.\n\n[Question]\nLi Hua should feel surprised about this unexpected festival, but he actually feels excited. Why is this?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Li Hua finds some food and music he really likes in the festival celebration.\nB. Li Hua unexpectedly wins a small prize at the celebration, which makes him feel surprised and excited.\nC. Li Hua meets some new friends at the celebration and plays with them happily.\nD. This festival displays a rich culture and the locals are very enthusiastic towards him.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0011694907902357837,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e33ad6006945d2804a7f","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368314257,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:38:34","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"8f026a4126f943c1857928885f259c07"}